> GET /theme.php

< HTTP/1.1 200 OK
< Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

Theme: light

> GET /theme.php?theme=dark

< HTTP/1.1 200 OK
< Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
< Set-Cookie: theme=dark; expires=…; Max-Age=31536000; path=/; secure; HttpOnly; SameSite=Lax

Theme saved: dark

> GET /theme.php

< HTTP/1.1 200 OK
< Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

Theme: dark
